      "value": "A demonstration of a shader which sharpens the appearance of black and white masks. It looks like a perfect vector, but with bicubic as a prefiltering method, only needs one channel of a 1K map to achieve this level of clarity. Could be a Godsend for tattoos on characters. 512 also looks incredible!",
