      "value": "@{62df7cd83e007e467295c4e1|full_name}: This can be done in-shader. These examples were all made using Amplify's bicubic solution. Some kind of solution that makes it easier for users to author bicubic lightmaps and textures would be a Godsend for developers looking to get extremely high quality textures for a very low performance cost, totally eliminate pixilation, and allow lower resolutions to look much, much better.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
